  "description": "David (and his brother Daniel) launched Shipper, an AI app builder. But here's the secret... they didn't reinvent the wheel. They just saw a billion-dollar opportunity and thought, \"if we capture just 1% of the market, maybe it could change our lives?\" This is the story of how they grew shipper to over $50K/month by building a micro-version of a billion-dollar market.\n\n*Free Database: 50+ AI App Ideas Making Millions* https://clickhubspot.com/zgul \n\nFollow David: https://twitter.com/chhddavid\nCheck out Shipper: https://shipper.now/\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: @StarterStoryBuild \n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\nChapters:\n0:00 - Every idea is taken… \n0:49 - What’s your story?\n1:27 - Business breakdown\n2:46 - Founder background\n3:29 - More AI App Ideas\n4:14 - Idea behind the business\n4:54 - Build story\n5:45 - Tech stack\n6:17 - Growth and marketing\n7:21 - Finding the 1% difference\n9:15 - Advice to younger self\n10:05 - Pat and Gus reflections: Copy & Paste",
